DESCRIPTION:Join our weekly Prestigious Scholarships Info Sessions to lear
 n about nationally competitive scholarships and fellowships that support 
 graduate study\, research\, internships\, public service\, and internatio
 nal opportunities. Learn more about awards such as Marshall Rhodes\, Trum
 an\, and more\, while exploring eligibility\, application timelines\, and
  program support at Montclair State University. Open to students from all
  majors. Sessions are held Wednesdays at 1:00 PM on Zoom. RSVP on Engage 
 to receive the Zoom link. A google calendar invite will be sent once RSVP
 . \n\nHosted by: Prestigious Scholarships \n\nAdditional Information can 
 be found at: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12469445
