DESCRIPTION:Join the Bloomfield College Library in celebrating Pride Month
 !\nWe will host a film screening of "Southern Pride" (2018) in L14. [Film
  description per Kanopy: This inspiring documentary profiles two lesbian 
 bar owners in Mississippi battling to host local Pride events in the wake
  of fresh ignorance and hatred stirred up by the election of Donald Trump
 .]\nWe also invite you to visit our Pride Month display on the first floo
 r.\n\nHosted by: Sprague Library\n\nAdditional Information can be found a
 t: https://montclair.campuslabs.com/engage/event/12484068
